ening/linux_workstation_hardening.yml' on both compromised hosts to remediate vulnerabilities."}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:40:00Z", "description": "Incident containment confirmed. No further C2 traffic observed."}]}, "justification": "LLM proposed: T13_dashboard"}
